        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RELIABILITY:         Performs as expected under designed operating conditions\n  \"The bridge is rated for 40-ton trucks 99.9% of the time\"\n  Measured: MTBF, availability %, failure rate\n  Threat: normal wear, component failure within design envelope"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#005",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience, git-history:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience]",
