        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RESILIENCE:          Absorbs disruption, adapts, and recovers fully\n  \"The bridge is destroyed by a flood, but the region quickly restores\n   connectivity via ferry service, then temporary bridge, then permanent bridge\"\n  Measured: time to recovery, functionality during disruption\n  Threat: events well outside design envelope (surprises, Black Swans)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#007",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
