        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RELATIONSHIP:\n  Reliability ensures normal operations\n  Robustness prevents easy failure\n  Resilience ensures recovery when failure occurs anyway\n  All three are necessary; none is sufficient alone\n```"
    },
