        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Better resilience: smaller triangle area (less lost functionality for less time)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#015",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
