        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ROBUSTNESS:     Ability to absorb stress without catastrophic failure\n  Design for excess capacity (factor of safety)\n  Redundancy in critical systems\n  Hardening against known hazards\n  Example: bridge designed for 150% of expected load"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#021",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience, git-history:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience]",
