        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RESOURCEFULNESS: Ability to manage disruption (human and material)\n  Emergency planning and procedures\n  Resource stockpiling (fuel, water, supplies)\n  Mutual aid agreements (utility-to-utility assistance)\n  Trained response personnel\n  Example: city pre-positions 3-day generator fuel supply in critical facilities"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#022",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
