        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "RAPID RECOVERY: Speed of returning to normal function\n  Pre-negotiated contracts with repair contractors\n  Cached spare parts (transformers, pipes, generator parts)\n  Clear decision authorities (who can authorize what spending)\n  Community recovery plans\n  Example: utility pre-orders one spare 345kV transformer (12-month lead time if not)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#023",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
