        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ADAPTABILITY: Learning and improving after events\n  After-action reviews (AAR)\n  Incorporating new hazard data (updated FEMA maps, climate projections)\n  Updating design standards after failures\n  Example: post-Sandy NYC hospitals elevated critical equipment from basement to roof"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#024",
