        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SAIDI (System Average Interruption Duration Index):\n  Average hours of power outage per customer per year\n  SAIDI = sum(Customer Interruption Duration) / Total Customers Served\n  Units: customer-hours / customer = hours/customer/year"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#030",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience, git-history:infrastructure-systems:03-resilience]",
        "canonical_path": "infrastructure-systems/03-RESILIENCE.md",
