        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Comparison by territory:\n    Premium utilities (well-maintained, underground): 1-2 hours\n    Average US utility: 5-8 hours\n    Rural cooperative: 8-15 hours\n    Developing world: 50-500 hours (Africa: some areas >200 hrs/yr)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#032",
      "path": [
        "03-RESILIENCE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
