        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Infrastructure Resilience: Frameworks, Metrics, and Investment",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SAIFI (System Average Interruption Frequency Index):\n  Average number of interruptions per customer per year\n  SAIFI = sum(Customer Interruptions) / Total Customers Served\n  Units: interruptions/customer/year"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RESILIENCE.md#033",
